    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gnomich</strong> is a clicker game where you mine resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your dwarf and get more resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a random mineral every 3 hours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The chances of falling out within 3 hours in the game*:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular - 70%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common - 25%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon - 4.89%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare - 0.1%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic - 0.01%</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to add to your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different looks for your pickaxe and gnome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system of temporary improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard via Discord and Telegram! Join us!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* - Can be changed</p>",
